{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@interface","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNMapSnapshotter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSObject","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSObject"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/StaticSnapshotExample"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can change the snapshotter’s options at any time and reuse the snapshotter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for multiple distinct snapshots; however, the snapshotter can only generate one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"snapshot at a time. If you need to generate multiple snapshots concurrently,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create multiple snapshotter objects."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For an interactive map, use the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"},{"type":"text","text":" class. Both "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"},{"type":"text","text":" are compatible with offline packs managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" class."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From a snapshot, you can obtain an image and convert geographic coordinates to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the image’s coordinate space in order to superimpose markers and overlays. If"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you do not need offline map functionality, you can use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Snapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" class in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/mapbox\/MapboxStatic.swift\/"},{"type":"text","text":" to generate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"static map images with overlays."}]},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let camera = MLNMapCamera(lookingAtCenter: CLLocationCoordinate2D(latitude: 37.7184, longitude:","-122.4365), altitude: 100, pitch: 20, heading: 0)","","let options = MLNMapSnapshotOptions(styleURL: MLNStyle.satelliteStreetsStyleURL, camera: camera,","size: CGSize(width: 320, height: 480)) options.zoomLevel = 10","","let snapshotter = MLNMapSnapshotter(options: options)","snapshotter.start { (snapshot, error) in","    if let error = error {","        fatalError(error.localizedDescription)","    }","","    image = snapshot?.image","}"]},{"anchor":"Related-examples","type":"heading","level":4,"text":"Related examples"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Create a static map snapshot, learn how to use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter"},{"type":"text","text":" to generate a static image based on an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object’s style, camera, and view bounds."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter"},{"type":"text","text":" generates static raster images of the map. Each snapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"image depicts a portion of a map defined by an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotOptions"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you provide. The snapshotter generates an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asynchronously, calling "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotterDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":" methods if defined, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passing it into a completion handler once tiles and other resources needed for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the snapshot are finished loading."}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapsnapshotter"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Class","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"MLNMapSnapshotter","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapSnapshotter","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MLNMapSnapshotter","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"text":"MLNMapSnapshotter","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/objc(cs)NSObject"],"kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom"},{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStylable"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"mi